# Nothing here is read by `next build`, and all of it would otherwise be
# uploaded into the build context on every deploy.

# The media masters — ~100 MB of source GIFs and MP4s that only
# `pnpm media:build` ever touches. What the site actually serves is their
# re-encoded output in public/media, which stays.
assets/source

# Tests and their artifacts.
e2e
playwright-report
test-results

# Design-system tooling: consumed by `pnpm lint:adherence` and `pnpm ds:sync`,
# both of which run in CI, never during a deploy build.
.design-system
